B.Ki=s(["Ported the game to a simple game engine for better performance and future-proofing.","Enhanced graphics and effects, including new scanline shader.","Added Settings overlay with audio, haptics, and graphics options.","Added mute button to main menu and pause overlay.","Added a combo system: consecutive crab hits build a multiplier up to x5, hitting the wrong target or letting the chain time out breaks it.","Added a changelog and power info overlay to the About screen.","Added a disclaimer overlay to the About screen.","Ported powers: Bazinga, Mana, Timer Pause, Gento, 8 Ton Ball, Wyat, What, SFTS, Crimzone, WMIAN, and Quit.","Modified the scoring system to accommodate the new combo system and powers.","Modified some power mechanics and scoring values for better balance and game feel.","Added new visual effects for some poowers and scoring events."],t.s)
